 "title": "Official Mercer County, Ohio Government Website | Mercer County, Ohio",
 "text": "Official Mercer County, Ohio Government Website | Mercer County, Ohio\nTHE OFFICIAL WEBSITE OF MERCER COUNTY OHIO\nElected Officials Auditor\nClerk of Courts\nCommissioners\nCommon Pleas Court\nEngineer\nProbate / Juvenile Court\nProsecutor\nRecorder\nSheriff\nTreasurer\nCounty Services Board of Developmental Disabilities\nBoard of Elections\nChild Support Enforcement Agency\nCommunity Development\nDog Control Services\nEmergency Management Agency\nEmergency Medical Services\nHealth Department\nJob & Family Services\nLakefield Airport\nPlanning Commission\nPublic Defender\nSoil and Water Conservation\nSolid Waste Management\nTri County ADAMHS\nMercer County Veterans Service Commission\nAbout Us\nOn April 4, 2002, the Board of Mercer County Commissioners adopted an official county flag. The flag design represents Mercer County, Ohio’s pride and strength…\nLEARN MORE\nWelcome to Mercer County!\nMercer County boasts a serene, countryside setting and the largest in-land lake in Ohio. We are located along the western board of Ohio centrally located between the metropolitan cities of Columbus, Toledo, Cincinnati, and Indianapolis.\nEstablished in 1820, our region’s roots are rich in agriculture. Our economy is diversified and thriving providing employment opportunities in key industries such as agricultural/food, health, education, manufacturing, and transportation logistics. Our sense of community is built upon strong work ethics and strong commitment to our family, quality education, and faith.\nWe welcome you to visit Mercer County – discover our small-town charm, recreation trails, museums, festivals, and more. Discover why approximately 40,783 residents proudly call Mercer County home and why some refer to that home as “God’s Country”.\nTo learn more about our rich heritage, click here .\nQuick Links\nMercer County Flag\nOffice and Holiday Hours\nLocation\nDirectory\nTownship and Village Links\nDoing Business\nGreater Grand Lake CVB\nCelina Mercer Chamber\nCareers Hometown Opportunity\nOhio Means Jobs\nEmployment Application\nMercer County Open Positions\nPublic Meetings\nWhat are you looking for?\nPay Real Estate Bill\nRegister to Vote\nPay Sanitary Sewer Bill\nCourt View\nParcel Search & GIS\nRecorder Search\nGov Deals / Sales\nRegister to Vote\nParcel Search & GIS\nRecorder Search\nCourt View\nGov Deals / Sales\nPay Real Estate Bill\nPay Sanitary Sewer Bill\nRegister to Vote\nParcel Search & GIS\nRecorder Search\nCourt View\nGov Deals / Sales\nPay Real Estate Bill\nPay Sanitary Sewer Bill\nRegister to Vote\nParcel Search & GIS\nRecorder Search\nHome\nDisclaimer\nPublic Records Policy\nEmployee Login\nTransparency in Coverage Rule\nAffirmative Consent\n© Copyright 2025 Mercer County, Ohio | 101 North Main Street | Celina, Ohio 45822\nPhoto Credit\nHome\nDisclaimer\nPublic Records Policy\nEmployee Login\nTransparency in Coverage Rule\nAffirmative Consent\n101 North Main Street | Celina, Ohio 45822\n© Copyright 2025 Mercer County, Ohio\nPhoto Credit\nMenu",
